        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If we are unable to transfer data between and among countries in which we operate, it could affect the manner in which we provide our services, the geographical location or segregation of our systems and operations and could adversely affect our financial results.",
        "start_character": 21831,
        "end_character": 22095
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001364954-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001364954-26-000021-3b7d92119ed723b4",
        "accession_number": "0001364954-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We continue to invest in expanding our skilling offerings and integrating them with our core academic services to provide a differentiated, end-to-end solution that supports the whole learner.",
        "start_character": 931,
        "end_character": 1123
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001364954-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001364954-26-000021-3b7d92119ed723b4",
        "accession_number": "0001364954-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "While we do not have any competitors that compete with us across our business in its entirety, we face significant competition from education and learning companies, many of which are developing their own AI products and technologies, as well as other companies that are not specifically focused on education and learning services but whose broad AI offerings may nonetheless significantly impact education and learning.",
        "start_character": 7654,
        "end_character": 8074
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001364954-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001364954-26-000021-3b7d92119ed723b4",
        "accession_number": "0001364954-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Under the PPL, we are required to, among other things, register our databases in Israel, take steps to secure personal data and sensitive data such as creating a database settings document, developing an information security policy and training employees.",
        "start_character": 22970,
        "end_character": 23225
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001364954-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001364954-26-000021-3b7d92119ed723b4",
        "accession_number": "0001364954-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also provide workforce skilling programs that help employers develop and retain talent.",
        "start_character": 2325,
        "end_character": 2415
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001364954-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001364954-26-000021-3b7d92119ed723b4",
        "accession_number": "0001364954-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We prioritize the retention, growth, and development of our employees.",
        "start_character": 25474,
        "end_character": 25544
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001364954-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001364954-26-000021-3b7d92119ed723b4",
        "accession_number": "0001364954-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We are leveraging this data within our product to improve the learning experience of the students.",
        "start_character": 5146,
        "end_character": 5244
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001364954-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001364954-26-000021-3b7d92119ed723b4",
        "accession_number": "0001364954-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We are subject to a number of laws and regulations in the United States and abroad that affect companies conducting business on the Internet and in the education industry, many of which are still evolving and could be interpreted in ways that could harm our business.",
        "start_character": 11355,
        "end_character": 11622
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001364954-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001364954-26-000021-3b7d92119ed723b4",
        "accession_number": "0001364954-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We believe these investments position us to drive deeper engagement, expand our addressable market, and return the business to sustainable revenue growth over time.",
        "start_character": 1326,
        "end_character": 1490
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001364954-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001364954-26-000021-3b7d92119ed723b4",
        "accession_number": "0001364954-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "In particular, we are subject to payment card association operating rules, certification requirements, and rules governing electronic funds transfers, which could change or be reinterpreted to make it difficult or impossible for us to comply.",
        "start_character": 15062,
        "end_character": 15304
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001364954-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001364954-26-000021-3b7d92119ed723b4",
        "accession_number": "0001364954-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "We are also required to obtain consent from consumers in certain circumstances and adhere to certain data transfer mechanisms to transfer EU personal data to certain other jurisdictions.",
        "start_character": 21291,
        "end_character": 21477
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001364954-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001364954-26-000021-3b7d92119ed723b4",
        "accession_number": "0001364954-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "We are evolving our platform to support learners both in the classroom and beyond, leveraging AI to deliver faster, more personalized, and more effective learning experiences.",
